( custom words )
: dropall 0 dsp ! ;
: chkpt here chkpt-size allot >r : ' dropall , r> dup >r postpone literal ' chkpt-restore , postpone ; postpone immediate r> chkpt! ;
: 2drop drop drop ;
: 2dup over over ;
: 2swap rot >r rot r> ;
: 2over 3 pick 3 pick ;
: log" compiling @ if postpone s" ' tell , else here postpone s" tell h ! fi ; immediate
: fmt 132 sys ;
: fmt" compiling @ if postpone s" ' fmt , else here >r postpone s" fmt r> h ! fi ; immediate
: floor 133 sys ;
: ceil 134 sys ;
: round 135 sys ;
: trunc 136 sys ;



